Package: datapond
Title: Query Curated 'DuckDB' Databases Built from Public Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Ian", "Nason", , "ign.nason@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Connects to the 'datapond' registry of curated 'DuckDB' databases
    built from public government and research data (immigration courts,
    campaign finance, clinical trials, Medicare, and more). Databases are
    attached remotely over HTTP so only the byte ranges a query touches are
    transferred, or downloaded once for local use. Returns standard 'DBI'
    connections that work with 'dbplyr'.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: en-US
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
